--- IDC Strategic Dashboard Secrets ---

Generate a long, random string for session security

You can use: python -c 'import os; print(os.urandom(24).hex())'

FLASK_SECRET_KEY="your_generated_random_string_here"

--- Azure AD (Entra ID) Credentials ---

From your App Registration Overview page

AZURE_TENANT_ID="your-tenant-id-from-azure"
AZURE_CLIENT_ID="your-client-id-from-azure"

From Certificates & secrets page (the Value, not the ID)

AZURE_CLIENT_SECRET="your-client-secret-value-from-azure"